        "key": {
          "description": "Explicit new-authoring selection for selector operator; applies only in selector comparison. Preserve source-effective values and visible overrides; no runtime fallback. Decision22 selection/API contract: Registry key/value-name identity is case-insensitive in the Registry API. Preserve spelling and registry view. Empty value name requests the default value; null name/key is structural only where already allowed, not a wildcard. Collected-value comparisons remain independent. Sources: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/sysinfo/structure-of-the-registry https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/microsoft.win32.registry.getvalue?view=net-10.0",
